  Pattern-Konvention: XSD-targetNamespace = <data name="URI">-URI
  (User-Vorgabe 2026-05-21).

  Block-Form im .forge-File:

      <variable name="xT_1">
        <type><BOOL/></type>
        <addData>
          <data name="https://forgeiec.io/v2/variable" handleUnknown="discard">
            <ForgeIecVar xmlns="https://forgeiec.io/v2/variable"
                         monitorEnabled="true"
                         createdMs="1779350554724"
                         accessedMs="1779350554724"
